{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0276","paragraphs":[{"id":"pffcf42d5afc8-1","text":"楼阴缺。"},{"id":"pfa7c9790201a-1","text":"阑干影卧东厢月。"},{"id":"pf243e297d9a1-1","text":"东厢月。"},{"id":"pa58003af8be6-1","text":"一天风露，杏花如雪。"},{"id":"peec53d1aa1ba-1","text":"隔烟催漏金虬咽。"},{"id":"pfa3f70b1d916-1","text":"罗帏暗淡灯花结。"},{"id":"p6ce4b4a9ed6c-1","text":"灯花结。"},{"id":"p8921e23c3a78-1","text":"片时春梦，江南天阔。"}]}